}],"card":{"title":"Bone Chips (Kaladim)","lines":["Minimum Level: 1","Classes: All","Related Zones: Butcherblock Mountains","Related NPCs: a decaying dwarf skeleton, a dwarf skeleton","Faction note: Gunlok Jure is located at 1315, 158, 39 in the Paladin guild. You must have Indifferent faction to complete this quest."]},"links":["Bone Chips Quests","Kaladim","Gunlok Jure","Butcherblock Mountains","A decaying dwarf skeleton","A dwarf skeleton","Rusty Axe","Rusty Broad Sword","Rusty Mace","Rusty Two Handed Sword","Small Lantern","Small Patchwork Boots","Small Patchwork Cloak","Small Patchwork Pants","Small Patchwork Sleeves","Small Patchwork Tunic","Small Tattered Belt","Small Tattered Gloves","Small Tattered Gorget","Small Tattered Mask","Small Tattered Shoulderpads","Small Tattered Skullcap","Small Tattered Wristbands","Torch","Bone Chips","Clerics of Underfoot","Kazon Stormhammer","Miners Guild 249","Cromil's Remains"],"dialogue":[{"npc":"Gunlok Jure","text":"Hail, ______! Bow before the greatness of the Clerics of Underfoot! It is good to be a paladin in such an order as ours - to fight the good fight and defend Kaladim from the evil and undead. If you be a paladin, then I pray you find the [courage to battle the undead]."},{"npc":"Gunlok Jure","text":"Yes!! To battle the undead is our greatest call. There has been a rise in the number of dwarven skeletons seen in the Butcherblocks. If you are a true member of this order, I shall reward you for the return of four bone chips. We shall defend our land from evil!"},{"npc":"Gunlok Jure","text":"I called for the remains of four skeletons."},{"npc":"Gunlok Jure","text":"I called for the remains of four skeletons."},{"npc":"Gunlok Jure","text":"I called for the remains of four skeletons."},{"npc":"Gunlok Jure","text":"You have done well. We thank you for your deed with this humble reward. The power behind the raising of our dead shall soon be found. You will earn more respect with more bone chips. I only wish you could 