olf"]},"links":["Rivervale","Beek Guinders","Kithicor Forest","Misty Thicket","A black wolf","Courage","Cure Poison","Divine Aura","Flash of Light","Minor Healing","Spook the Dead","Strike","True North","Yaulp","Cure Blindness","Cure Disease","Furor","Gate","Holy Armor","Light Healing","Reckless Strength","Stun","Summon Drink","Ward Undead","Ruined Wolf Pelt","Black Wolf Skin","Berries","Priests of Mischief","Mayor Gubbin","Guardians of the Vale"],"dialogue":[{"npc":"Beek Guinders waves enthusiastically and","text":"Hay, ho, there, young ______! I'd love to yak it up with you but I'm a bit busy at the moment, trying to find some [help]."},{"npc":"Beek Guinders","text":"Well, we're experimenting with some tanning methods but we're running low on supplies. We need to find someone to go out and [gather some things]. Seems no one wants to do an honest day's work any more. I'd do it myself but, errrr, my, uhhh, foot hair has been hurting lately... yes, that's it."},{"npc":"Beek Guinders","text":"Hey, great! You found the materials! We'll get to work right away. If you find any more, please come by again. Here's a little something for your troubles, friend."}],"fetchedAt":"2026-09-23T06:39:33.863Z","outOfEra":false}
Bug Collection	25	{"kind":"quest","title":"Bug Collection","wikiPath":"/Bug_Collection","sources":[{"kind":"quest","where":"Misty Thicket","detail":"Start zone"},{"kind":"quest","where":"Blixkin Entopop","detail":"Quest giver"}],"components":[],"rewards":[{"text":"Bracelet of Beetlekind","item":"Bracelet of Beetlekind","wikiPath":"/Bracelet_of_Beetlekind"},{"text":"Potion of Poison Warding","item":"Potion of Poison Warding","wikiPath":"/Potion_of_Poison_Warding"},{"text":"Silver Bracelet","item":"Silver Bracelet","wikiPath":"/Silver_Bracelet"},{"text":"Spider Venom","item":"Spider Venom","wikiPath":"/Spider_Venom"},{"text":"Stalking Probe","item":"Stalking Probe","wikiPath":"/Stalking_Probe"}],"card":{"title":"Bug Collection","lines":["Minimum Level: 14","Classes: All","Related Zones: Western Karana, Kithicor Forest, North Qeynos","Related NPCs: Queen Klaknak, a fire beetle, a giant fire beetle, a giant scarab, a giant wasp, a spiderling, a giant yellowjacket"]},"links":["Misty Thicket","Blixkin Entopop","Western Karana","Kithicor Forest","North Qeynos","Queen Klaknak","A fire beetle","A giant fire beetle","A giant scarab","A giant wasp","A spiderling","A giant yellowjacket","Bracelet of Beetlekind","Strengthen","Potion of Poison Warding","Counteract Poison","Silver Bracelet","Cure Poison","Spider Venom","Weakening Poison I","Stalking Probe","Stalking Probe (Spell)","Spiderling Eye","Spiderling Silk","Fire Beetle Eye","Giant Scarab Egg Sack","Giant Fire Beetle Leg","Giant Wasp Wing","Merchants of Rivervale","Deeppockets","Guardians of the Vale","Mayor Gubbin","Coalition of Tradefolk Underground"],"dialogue":[{"npc":"Blixkin Entopop","text":"Hail! My name is Blixkin Entopop. Have you seen the wonderful assortment of [spiders] and [beetles] that inhabit the thicket? I have quite an extensive [bug collection]. Be careful, though. I have seen many brave halflings fall beneath a [swarm] of clicking hissing bugs."},{"npc":"Blixkin Entopop","text":"I collect all kinds of bugs but most of the ones I have are dead. [Ember] is the only exception. I just like them for their pretty colors and I kind of admire how loyal they are to each other. If you want to, you can help me fill out my collection and I will reward you for your time. Here is a list of the bug parts I need for my collection. If you [don't have a bug collection box] to collect the bug parts, just ask me for one. I think I have some extras."},{"npc":"Blixkin Entopop","text":"Here you go. Just follow the instructions on the [list] so you know what to collect and how to prepare the collection for me."},{"npc":"Blixkin Entopop","text":"What did you do, lose the list? Here is another one. Hold onto it because I will want it back when you are done."},{"npc":"Blixkin Entopop","text":"Oh you have a complete collection for me?! Good! Good! Well done. But remember that I need the complete bug collection and you must return my want list before I can pay you."},{"npc":"Blixkin Entopop","text":"Excellent! Good work! I knew you were the one for this job! Thank you so much! My collection just gets better and better each day. Here is your reward as I promised."}],"fetchedAt":"2026-09-23T06:39:34.967Z","outOfEra":false}
The Gnome Take	25	{"kind":"quest","title":"The Gnome Take","wikiPath":"/The_Gnome_Take","sources":[{"kind":"quest","where":"North Kaladim","detail":"Start zone"},{"kind":"quest","where":"Jeet","detail":"Quest giver"}],"components":[],"rewards":[{"text":"Bead Necklace","item":"Bead Necklace","wikiPath":"/Bead_Necklace"},{"text":"Bloodstone","item":"Bloodstone","wikiPath":"/Bloodstone"},{"text":"Copper Amulet","item":"Copper Amulet","wikiPath":"/Copper_Amulet"},{"text":"Copper Band","item":"Copper Band","wikiPath":"/Copper_Band"},{"text":"Engagement Ring","item":"Engagement Ring","wikiPath":"/Engagement_Ring"},{"text":"Fire Beetle Eye","item":"Fire Beetle Eye","wikiPath":"/Fire_Beetle_Eye"},{"text":"Golden Ear Stud","item":"Golden Ear Stud","wikiPath":"/Golden_Ear_Stud"},{"text":"Hematite","item":"Hematite","wikiPath":"/Hematite"},{"text":"Iony's Absorber","item":"Iony's Absorber","wikiPath":"/Iony%27s_Absorber"},{"text":"Jasper","item":"Jasper","wikiPath":"/Jasper"},{"text":"Lapis Lazuli","item":"Lapis Lazuli","wikiPath":"/Lapis_Lazuli"},{"text":"Malachite","item":"Malachite","wikiPath":"/Malachite"},{"text":"Moonstone","item":"Moonstone","wikiPath":"/Moonstone"},{"text":"Onyx","item":"Onyx","wikiPath":"/Onyx"},{"text":"Royal Jelly","item":"Royal Jelly","wikiPath":"/Royal_Jelly"},{"text":"Silver Earring","item":"Silver Earring","wikiPath":"/Silver_Earring"},{"text":"Silver Stud","item":"Silver Stud","wikiPath":"/Silver_Stud"},{"text":"Silver Ring","item":"Silver Ring","wikiPath":"/Silver_Ring"},{"text":"Small Piece of Ore","item":"Small Piece of Ore","wikiPath":"/Small_Piece_of_Ore"},{"text":"Turquoise","item":"Turquoise","wikiPath":"/Turquoise"}],"card":{"title":"The Gnome Take","lines":["Minimum Level: 1","Classes: All","Related Zones: Ak'Anon","Related NPCs: clockwork scrubber","Faction note: This quest follows Rat Patrol, given by Jeet, located at 563, 193, -33 outside the Ratsbone Treasury & Assay Office. You must have Amiable faction to complete this quest."]},"links":["Kaladim","Jeet","Ak'Anon","Clockwork scrubber","Bead Necklace","Bloodstone","Copper Amulet","Copper Band","Engagement Ring","Fire Beetle Eye","Golden Ear Stud","Burning Affliction I","Hematite","Iony's Absorber","Jasper","Lapis Lazuli","Malachite","Moonstone","Onyx","Royal Jelly","Silver Earring","Silver Stud","Silver Ring","Small Piece of Ore","Turquoise","Rat Patrol","Clockwork Scrubber","Clockworks of Ak`Anon","Gnome Take","Miners Guild 628","Circle of Unseen Hands","Butcherblock Bandits","Deeppockets","Ebon Mask"],"dialogue":[{"npc":"Jeet","text":"Well, as you most likely know, we here are a non profit organization,.. In Kaladim. We need to make our profit elsewhere and that means a little bit of thieving. Presently we need loyal members to [collect the gnome profit]."},{"npc":"Jeet","text":"Take this key. Don't lose it!! You will need to use it on a metal rat called a Scrubber. They are all over Ak'Anon. You must find the one which responds to the number, '628'. If it responds then use the key on it. It will hand over a bag with the 'Gnome Take'. Return it to me. Get moving!!."},{"npc":"clockwork scrubber","text":"wiz... tik... 628"},{"npc":"Jeet","text":"What is all this junk! That blasted tin rat is supposed to be heisting expensive goods from rich gnomes - not all this garbage! Here. This is your cut of this junk."},{"npc":"Jeet","text":"Good work miner. This is a fantastic haul! Those wrinkly little gnomes don't know what is going on. Here is your cut. Now get back to work."}],"fetchedAt":"2026-09-23T06:39:36.049Z","outOfEra":false}
